[b]Objective:[/b]
The system output must be [color=#ffffff]1 (White/True)[/color].
Currently, the source is sending [color=#888888]0 (Black/False)[/color].
Drag the [color=#4bb8f0]NOT Gate[/color] to invert the signal.

[b]Truth Table (Reference):[/b]
[table=2]
[cell border=#444444 bg=#222222][color=#4bb8f0] [b]INPUT (A)[/b] [/color][/cell] [cell border=#444444 bg=#222222][color=#ff5555] [b]OUTPUT (NOT A)[/b] [/color][/cell]
[cell border=#444444 bg=#111111] 0 (Black) [/cell] [cell border=#444444 bg=#111111] 1 (White) [/cell]
[cell border=#444444 bg=#111111] 1 (White) [/cell] [cell border=#444444 bg=#111111] 0 (Black) [/cell]
[/table]

[b]The Logic:[/b]
The NOT gate simply flips the color to its opposite.
[color=#888888]// Java Equivalent:[/color]
[code]boolean y = !x;[/code]"
